    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate a pool of unique product descriptions from one AI-written spintax template\n\n### How it works\n\n1. An LLM writes ONE spintax template from your brief; the Spintax node renders every variant from it, with no model call per document.\n2. The template is validated first, and an invalid draft gets one repair round aimed at the exact line and column.\n3. Twelve documents are rendered with a per-attempt seed, so a rerun reproduces the pool.\n4. Lint judges each document and returns a defective one for another draw.\n5. Uniqueness judges the whole pool and reports a footprint before it ships.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the community node `n8n-nodes-spintax`.\n- [ ] Add OpenAI credentials to the two chat model nodes.\n- [ ] Put your brief, product facts, locale and variables in **Your brief and product**.\n- [ ] Run it once — a valid draft renders twelve variants in one pass.\n\n### Customization\n\nFootprint Limit ships at 1, so Uniqueness reports instead of gating: one template about one product scores near 0.49. Ignored Strings already holds the product name and brand, which moves the same twelve documents from 0.209 to 0.107.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        64
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d00",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Start and set your inputs\n\nOne Set node holds the brief, the product facts, the locale and the variable names. Everything downstream reads them from here.",
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        96
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d01",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Author the spintax template\n\nThe node builds the canonical authoring prompt from your brief and allowed variables; your model writes one template from it.",
        "width": 416,
        "height": 544,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        384,
        96
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0002-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d02",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Validate the draft\n\nValid means no error-level diagnostics. Valid drafts go straight to rendering; the rest take the repair path below.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 368,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        832,
        64
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0003-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d03",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Repair once, then stop\n\nThe repair prompt carries the exact line and column of each problem. The loop is capped at one round by wiring, so it cannot spin.",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1056,
        480
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0004-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d04",
      "name": "Sticky Note4"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Render and lint variants\n\nTwelve documents come out of one template. Lint judges each one and sends anything defective back for another draw.",
        "width": 416,
        "height": 512,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1712,
        96
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0005-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d05",
      "name": "Sticky Note5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Check pool uniqueness\n\nUniqueness judges the pool rather than a document and reports a footprint. Near-duplicates leave on the second output.",
        "width": 416,
        "height": 512,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2144,
        96
      ],
      "id": "a1b2c3d4-0006-4a11-9c01-5f1a2b3c4d06",
      "name": "Sticky Note6"
    }
